  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Aztec -- the leading ZK privacy rollup enabling confidential smart contract execution. Store OASIS holons and avatar data with cryptographic privacy, keeping sensitive information shielded while maintaining verifiability. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
